  "Kill quests drop from various monsters and are automatically accepted when you obtain their Kill Quest drops. Kills add to your quest counter for the listed NPC IDs, and quests may be repeatable, daily, or weekly reset. Combo quests (e.g., “Yes (500 kills)”) count total kills across the target list toward a shared goal. Use the": "擊殺任務由各種怪物掉落，取得擊殺任務掉落物時會自動接受。擊殺所列 NPC ID 的怪物會累積任務計數，任務可能是可重複、每日或每週重置。組合任務（例如「Yes (500 kills)」）會把目標清單內的總擊殺數計入共同目標。在遊戲內使用",
  "command in-game to track progress and claim rewards.": "指令追蹤進度並領取獎勵。",
  "“Repeatable”, “Daily Reset”, and “Weekly Reset” control whether progress can be redone and when it becomes available again.": "「可重複」、「每日重置」與「每週重置」決定進度能否重做，以及何時再次開放。",
  "Daily quests reset at midnight ET (America/New York).": "每日任務在美東時間（America/New York）午夜重置。",
  "Weekly quests reset at the configured weekly reset time: Wednesday at 10:00 AM ET (America/New York).": "每週任務在設定的每週重置時間重置：週三 10:00 ET（America/New York）。",
  "“Party Share” shows whether kills from party members contribute.": "「隊伍共享」顯示隊友的擊殺是否計入。",
  "Targets list required NPC IDs and counts; “Sources” show which NPCs drop the quest token and at what chance.": "目標列出所需的 NPC ID 與數量；「來源」顯示哪些 NPC 會掉落任務道具及其機率。",
